This project (the Rakkase repository) consists of scripts, a launcher engine, documentation, example plans and tests. It does not contain any model
weights and no generated music except one 15-second reference clip (`testler/referans/aday1_intro_neseli_15sn.wav`, an instrumental clip generated by
this project's own run with ACE-Step 1.5 turbo, seed 42, no voice cloning, no third-party recording, used by `python rakkase.py test`).

